<section class="section"><div class="container"><h1 class="title">WiseSloth.open</h1><p>A self-hosted quiz and flashcard platform. Generate study material from notes, exams, PDFs, instructions and public web links, then share quizzes with your friends or class.</p><p class="mt-4">This instance is managed by its host. AI uses the host's provider key unless you save your own in <a href="/settings">Settings</a>. There are no token allowances or subscriptions.</p><p class="mt-4"><a href="https://github.com/alejp1998/wisesloth.open">Read the source and self-hosting guide</a>.</p></div></section>
